{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "7065ad670bd5c3cb6a64cd8629c806ffffbd6c11a4a340536c1a350ef78fa7a1", "ja": "ああ、{$P$}さん！\n急いでくださいっ！　早くしないと……！", "zh": "啊啊，{$P$}先生！\n请快一点！再不快点的话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5a28ed5e92fd37526edc1a7d817c4c4c08704d9ba6ac2792bdbb012a0e154edb", "ja": "ゆ、百合子！　まずは着替えよう！\n濡れたままじゃ、救えるものも救えない！！", "zh": "优、优莉子！先把衣服换了吧！\n一直湿着的话，能救的也救不了了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "dc5b8b5cad37ed55e9be4ce3c08e58761c29387b5f101e3c249718c86d3c9786", "ja": "そ、そうですね……！　あとは任せました！\n私が戻るまで、どうか無事で……！", "zh": "是、是啊……！接下来就交给你了！\n在我回来之前，请一定要平安……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "d6915e77bd0ad00e603608a84555e655988a5f233e9e8493e6a173c1e5f8032b", "ja": "はぁはぁ……おまたせしました！\n{$P$}さん、容体は……！？", "zh": "呼、呼……让您久等了！  \n{$P$}先生的情况怎么样了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1004_p", "source_sha256": "938e80d47957875aad7520b4cc6601f781049a66997895f0469dc9dc63a714b2", "ja": "わからん……とにかく早く処置しないと……！\nだがコピー用紙で、本当に救えるのか？", "zh": "我也不清楚……总之必须赶紧处理才行……！\n但是用复印纸，真的能救回来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "a43cfba8a1bbe5e8d5131fef695116d803902ee9e44ae1193c0911d6e0405fc1", "ja": "はい！　濡れたページに1枚ずつ挟んでください！\nページが破れないように、優しく優し～く……。", "zh": "好的！请在被水打湿的页面之间，每次夹入1张复印纸！\n为了不让页面破损，要轻轻地、轻～轻地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "f91a8e34d9d36bfe7389646dc30842e79835065389e4de1151915af42be8b583", "ja": "全ページに挟んだら、何か重いものを……あっ！\nこれがいいかも。よいしょ……これでよしっ！", "zh": "全部页面都夹好后，再压上什么重物……啊！\n这个好像不错。嘿咻……这样就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2063bde45baea12de695f9eb92599282bfc9a18447300c56120d889ad05716f8", "ja": "ふぅ。百合子がビーチボートから落ちたときは\n驚いたが……ひとまずは大丈夫、かな？", "zh": "呼……百合子从海滩漂浮船上掉下去的时候真是吓了我一跳……暂时应该没事了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "879eebf2bf48248747ecd956cd345518c111bf1b139ae97572aa98aefecfce48", "ja": "す、すみませんでした……。水上で優雅な読書を！と\n思ったんですけど、とんだ醜態を晒してしまって。", "zh": "对、对不起……我本来是想在水上优雅地看书的！没想到却出了这么大的丑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4ee3bfa641529aa1a39245c6a7a4ab9ccf6e764135ed1805c8435b7931599e7b", "ja": "いや、こっちこそ。\n急に声をかけて、ごめんな。", "zh": "不，该道歉的是我才对。\n突然出声叫你，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "e8c2c9d34d96bf70329dbdfafa6af5053effbdc98b9a8847b246b39a683021ef", "ja": "い、いえ！　読書に集中しすぎて、\n水の上にいることを忘れてた私が悪いんです。", "zh": "不、不！是我才要道歉！因为太专注于读书，忘了自己正在水面上，是我的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "77df1d9022c64a93098284ee04758fa3bfe3c7b7b2d5d0a6bbb2a0eda0e94eb8", "ja": "声にビックリして、バランスを崩しちゃって。\n気づいた時には水中に……うぅ……。", "zh": "被声音吓了一跳，结果失去了平衡。\n等回过神来已经在水里了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3e06b3a29c98d7f7b0ee441426044ff3ff44d52c8359c2746fe8443a1ba63b72", "ja": "でも落ちた瞬間、本を持った腕を\n水上に出してたのは、百合子らしかったな。", "zh": "不过，掉下去的瞬间，还把拿着书的手臂举出水面，这还真像百合子会做的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "106d99874e469e9705bc5b4eee385a2792e8f497430cb2759db7cd5ed458fdff", "ja": "えへへ……絶対に本は守らなくちゃって思って。\nなんとか1冊は水没を防ぎました！", "zh": "嘿嘿……我想着，绝对不能让书出事。\n总算设法让1本书没有被水淹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fdaa7e351efa873f744f23f820613cf4047027ed6cf875f770102c380144a7d6", "ja": "ああ、ナイスプレーだ！\n他の本は濡れてしまったけど、対処もさすがだな。", "zh": "啊，干得漂亮！\n虽然其他书还是被淋湿了，但你的处理也真是漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "ebb8af371db0dcff74aafb9004c9f5745e4aee36fa997e442d15660a45925ba8", "ja": "それは、雨で教科書が濡れることがあって、\nよくこの方法を試してたんです。", "zh": "因为有时教科书会被雨淋湿，所以我经常尝试这个方法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1016_p", "source_sha256": "277b05885d5285a723c860d62f1c6659dc7d1fc9462173ccb485aeb5e93bf2a9", "ja": "なるほど。経験と知識の積み重ねってことか。\nじゃあ、今回のことも何か今後に活かせるのかな？", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，这是经验和知识的积累吧。\n那么，这次的事情也能为今后提供什么借鉴吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "30c6d1de4c74c0701d48473c4b17b324e6fe6116f6385fbde08543c590fd32d6", "ja": "そうですね……。トラブルに動揺しないこと、\n落ち着いて行動すること。そして……。", "zh": "是啊……遇到突发状况时不要慌张，\n要冷静地采取行动。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1018_p", "source_sha256": "2697d136fe3c8761d0b06e82e98e6d45de063613011282e17ac5d60e4637552d", "ja": "そして……？", "zh": "然后……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0353_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "9609b5c6dee17b6142ec568b4df2c029a00fe370a19f81637f0483146e3ec756", "ja": "水の上で本を読むのはやめましょう！　ですねっ♪", "zh": "不要在水上看书！就是这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
